WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
A clip needs context before it needs captions.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Script: 0-3s: show a contextless quote card. 3-12s: add the question the speaker was answering. 12-25s: explain the takeaway in one sentence. 25-35s: show the clip with captions. Lesson: make the idea understandable on its own.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Try adding the original question above one clip.
